{"data":{"allEventsJson":{"edges":[{"node":{"date":"2012-07-25","content":"前身域名 lattespirit.com.cn，一年之后转成 <span class='text-pink-dark font-bold underline'>lattespirit.com</span>，博客第一次由 WordPress 驱动上线","effects":["fireworks"],"images":[{"alt":"V1.0 博客首页","path":{"publicURL":"/static/ad7075b88a03b5a6b165bc8594714f4b/v1.png"}}]}},{"node":{"date":"2014-01-28","content":"博客迁至 GitHub ，由 Jekyll 驱动，使用 Bootstrap v2 设计极简风格的界面","effects":[],"images":[{"alt":"V2.0 GitHub / Jekyll 界面","path":{"publicURL":"/static/594afbfbf37737cea78d947459639c60/v2.png"}}]}},{"node":{"date":"2015-10-20","content":"将第三方评论框由多说迁移至 Disqus","effects":[],"images":[{"alt":"Disqus 评论框","path":{"publicURL":"/static/aee201d792b52a1df0cbb9cb386601b4/disqus.png"}}]}},{"node":{"date":"2017-02-04","content":"博客前端框架 Bootstrap 版本升级至 v3，优化导航栏区分移动端和 PC 端，并增加整站搜索功能，按下 <span class='px-1 bg-pink-dark text-white rounded'>s</span> 键调出搜索框","effects":[],"images":[{"alt":"Bootstrap v3 整站搜索","path":{"publicURL":"/static/c51f0e725df20692795389841171ad28/bootstrap.svg"}}]}},{"node":{"date":"2019-12-29","content":"重构整站 UI，v3.0 上线，增加 <a class='text-pink-dark font-bold underline' href='/testimonials'>Testimonials</a>, <a class='text-pink-dark font-bold underline' href='/uses' >Uses</a> 和 <a class='text-pink-dark font-bold underline' href='/logos'>Typography</a>(可通过右键点击头部 Logo 进入) 页面","effects":["fireworks"],"images":[{"alt":"V3.0 Typography","path":{"publicURL":"/static/6dbfe02db48bc426f51777842ccf9f04/v3-typography.png"}},{"alt":"V3.0 Figma 设计稿","path":{"publicURL":"/static/32261b20a0c73b6e53c758c79456740e/v3-figma.png"}}]}},{"node":{"date":"2020-03-20","content":"告别 <span>Jekyll</span>，拥抱 <a href='https://www.gatsbyjs.org/' target='_blank'>Gatsby</a>，整站进行重构","effects":[],"images":[{"alt":"Gatsby","path":{"publicURL":"/static/0c1301a5069ee6121018595120341599/gatsby.svg"}}]}},{"node":{"date":"2025-03-30","content":"告别 <span class='text-pink-dark font-bold'>lattespirit.com</span>，回归 <span class='text-pink-dark font-bold'>lattes